sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as AddressManager/CheckoutPage
  participant API as addressApi
  participant Auth as protect Middleware
  participant C as addressController
  participant M as Address Model
  participant DB as MySQL
  UI->>API: replaceAddresses(list)
  API->>Auth: PUT /api/addresses
  Auth->>C: replaceAddresses
  C->>C: normalize, filter, choose one default
  C->>M: destroy current + bulkCreate next
  M->>DB: DELETE + INSERT
  DB-->>C: saved addresses
  C-->>UI: normalized address list
  UI->>API: getAddresses at checkout
  API-->>UI: current user's addresses
